cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Scrawly, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Scrawly: free, open-source SEO crawler and site audit tool"
abstract: >-
  Scrawly is a free, open-source desktop SEO crawler and technical site audit tool for
  macOS, Windows and Linux. It crawls a website, runs 250 technical SEO, GEO (Generative
  Engine Optimization) and agentic-web checks on every page, maps the site architecture,
  produces HTML and PDF reports, and can apply safe, reversible fixes to WordPress sites.
